OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation over body
OL,4,Afound in woods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched following the discovery of a
OL,8,Fman's body in woodland.
OL,10,FWiltshire Police said they were called
OL,11,Fout to a "concern for welfare" check in
OL,12,Fthe town of Ludgershall at 15:41 BST on
OL,13,F24 September.
OL,15,FTwo hours later officers discovered the
OL,16,Fbody of a man in his 60s near the polo
OL,17,Ffield close to Perham Down.
OL,19,FFollowing an initial post-mortem
OL,20,Fexamination, the death is being treated
OL,21,Fas suspicious, the force has now said.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
